{"sha": "226b6c5e8bc7e3843507ffb61ebe6f9ad70648c8705f145e1a91fdf33dbdcaad", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:the-mole} 章 --- 物质的量与摩尔质量}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:1}", "$M(\\ce{O2}) = 2 \\times 16.0 = \\qty{32.0}{g/mol}$;", "$M(\\ce{N2}) = 2 \\times 14.0 = \\qty{28.0}{g/mol}$;", "$M(\\ce{CH4}) = 12.0 + 4 \\times 1.0 = \\qty{16.0}{g/mol}$;", "$M(\\ce{NH3}) = 14.0 + 3 \\times 1.0 = \\qty{17.0}{g/mol}$;", "$M(\\ce{CO2}) = 12.0 + 2 \\times 16.0 = \\qty{44.0}{g/mol}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:2}", "水：$n = 36.0 / 18.0 = \\qty{2.00}{mol}$。甲烷：", "$n = 4.0 / 16.0 = \\qty{0.25}{mol}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:3}", "$m(\\ce{NaCl}) = 0.25 \\times 58.5 = \\qty{14.6}{g}$，约 \\qty{15}{g}；", "$m(\\ce{CO2}) = 2.0 \\times 44.0 = \\qty{88}{g}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:4}", "$N = 0.50 \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{3.0e23}$ 个氧气分子。", "$n = \\num{3.0e24} / \\qty{6.02e23}{mol^{-1}} = \\qty{5.0}{mol}$，即铁的物质的量。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:5}", "$V = n \\times V_m = 0.50 \\times 24.1 = \\qty{12}{L}$.", "$n = V / V_m = 12 / 24.1 = \\qty{0.50}{mol}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:6}", "液滴的质量为 \\qty{0.050}{g}，故", "$n = 0.050 / 18.0 = \\qty{2.8e-3}{mol}$，且", "$N = \\num{2.8e-3} \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{1.7e21}$ 个分子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:7}", "一个铝原子（\\qty{27.0}{g/mol}）的质量约为", "一个铁原子（\\qty{55.8}{g/mol}）的一半，故等质量的铝所含", "原子数约为铁的两倍。核对：铝 $10/27.0 = \\qty{0.370}{mol}$，即", "\\num{2.23e23} 个原子；铁 $10/55.8 = \\qty{0.179}{mol}$，即", "\\num{1.08e23} 个原子。铝的原子数约为铁的 2.1 倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:8}", "一升气体的物质的量为 $1/24.1 = \\qty{0.0415}{mol}$。二氧化碳：", "$0.0415 \\times 44.0 = \\qty{1.83}{g}$；氮气：", "$0.0415 \\times 28.0 = \\qty{1.16}{g}$。二氧化碳的密度约为空气的一倍半，", "而空气的摩尔质量与氮气相近。", "发酵的果汁会释放出二氧化碳，它会下沉", "并在封闭地窖近地面处积聚，可能使", "进入其中的人窒息。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:9}", "$M(\\ce{C6H12O6}) = 6 \\times 12.0 + 12 \\times 1.0 + 6 \\times 16.0 =", "\\qty{180.0}{g/mol}$。箭头 $\\div N_A$：$n = \\num{1.0e22} / \\num{6.02e23} =", "\\qty{1.66e-2}{mol}$；箭头 $\\times M$：$m = \\num{1.66e-2} \\times 180.0 =", "\\qty{3.0}{g}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:10}", "$M = \\qty{342.0}{g/mol}$，故 $n = 5.0 / 342.0 = \\qty{1.46e-2}{mol}$；", "$N = \\num{1.46e-2} \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{8.8e21}$ 个分子。每个", "含 12 个碳原子：$12 \\times \\num{8.8e21} = \\num{1.1e23}$ 个碳原子。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:11}", "水：$1000 / 18.0 = \\qty{55.6}{mol}$。乙醇：", "$M = 2 \\times 12.0 + 6 \\times 1.0 + 16.0 = \\qty{46.0}{g/mol}$，故", "$1000 / 46.0 = \\qty{21.7}{mol}$。水的物质的量更大，比值为", "$55.6 / 21.7 \\approx 2.6$，恰好等于 $46.0 / 18.0$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:12}", "金：$\\qty{3.75}{g}$，$n = 3.75 / 197.0 = \\qty{1.90e-2}{mol}$，即", "\\num{1.15e22} 个原子。铜：\\qty{1.25}{g}，", "$n = 1.25 / 63.5 = \\qty{1.97e-2}{mol}$，即 \\num{1.19e22} 个原子。", "出人意料的是，这枚戒指所含铜原子略多于金原子：", "一个金原子的质量约为一个铜原子的三倍。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:13}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $V = 8.0 \\times 6.0 \\times 3.0 = \\qty{144}{m^3} =", "        \\qty{1.44e5}{L}$; $n = \\num{1.44e5} / 24.1 = \\qty{5.98e3}{mol}$;", "        $N = \\num{5.98e3} \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{3.6e27}$ 个分子。", "  \\item $M = (78 \\times 28.0 + 21 \\times 32.0 + 1 \\times 40.0) / 100 =", "        2896 / 100 = \\qty{29.0}{g/mol}$.", "  \\item $m = \\num{5.98e3} \\times 29.0 = \\qty{1.73e5}{g}$，约", "        \\qty{173}{kg}：一间教室的空气重量与", "        两三个成年人相当。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:14}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $n = 1000 / 28.1 = \\qty{35.6}{mol}$，故", "        $N = 35.6 \\times \\num{6.02e23} = \\num{2.14e25}$ 个原子。", "  \\item $m = \\qty{1.000}{kg} / \\num{2.14e25} = \\qty{4.67e-26}{kg}$.", "  \\item 球的质量与摩尔质量可给出其物质的量，", "        $n = m / M$。若原子数 $N$ 另行独立求出（由", "        球的体积及晶体中原子的间距推算），", "        则比值 $N / n$ 即为阿伏伽德罗常数。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:the-mole:15}", "$M = 0.758 \\times 35.0 + 0.242 \\times 37.0 = 26.53 + 8.95 =", "\\qty{35.5}{g/mol}$：即表中的数值。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}